      "writtenOn": "2025-02-20T19:24:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks good. Have you concocted a test to make sure everything is OK if there is exactly enough room for a final entry plus the FALSE for no more entries plus the encoding of end of directory boolean? Ideally run the test with READDIR3, READDIRPLUS3, and READDIR4.",
      "revId": "f072d35ffec5814dc491d5e83238e2929713f7a2",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
