      "writtenOn": "2025-02-25T06:47:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think your concern does occur. Now only one boolean space is reserved when a new entry is placed. But we have two booleans, one for next entry and one for EOF. Please see the comment in nfs3_readdir.c.\n\nI need more time to adjust our FSAL implementation to fully test the boundary conditions. We can keep this patch open before I fully test them.",
      "parentUuid": "ea8df919_ab14b912",
      "revId": "f072d35ffec5814dc491d5e83238e2929713f7a2",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
    {
